{"seq":1,"slug":"reshaping-industries","title":"重塑产业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-space-industry","title":"航天产业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries/the-space-industry","wordCount":1584,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"automotive-and-energy","title":"汽车与能源产业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries/automotive-and-energy","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"重塑产业\">重塑产业</h1><p>马斯克的影响，首先体现在他对多个产业的彻底重塑。本章考察他改写格局的两大领域。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;航天产业&quot;——他如何激活一个长期沉寂的行业，开创商业航天的新时代。第二篇文档讲述&quot;汽车与能源产业&quot;,揭示他如何撬动百年汽车工业转型，并推动能源体系的可持续变革。</p>\n"}